    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tantalus is a sci-fi anomaly game set on a mysterious spaceship. Take on the role of a patrol staff member, investigate anomalies throughout the ship, and report them to the control AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patrol Staff Guide</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Do not overlook any anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. If an anomaly is detected, use the employee tablet to take a photo of the point and then move on to the next area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. The photo will be automatically submitted to the control AI, which will handle the issue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Complete patrol of Sector 1 through 8 before returning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 to 90 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD : Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C: Toggle Camera ON/OFF</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F: Open Door</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift: Sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC: Open Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adult Content Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains some scary monsters and aliens, blood, and supernatural horror elements.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tantalus is a sci-fi anomaly game set on a mysterious spaceship. Take on the role of a patrol staff member, investigate anomalies throughout the ship, and report them to the control AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patrol Staff Guide</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Do not overlook any anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. If an anomaly is detected, use the employee tablet to take a photo of the point and then move on to the next area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. The photo will be automatically submitted to the control AI, which will handle the issue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Complete patrol of Sector 1 through 8 before returning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 to 90 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD : Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C: Toggle Camera ON/OFF</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F: Open Door</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift: Sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC: Open Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adult Content Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains some scary monsters and aliens, blood, and supernatural horror elements.</p>",
